{"book":"fet-sequences","bookTitle":"Number patterns, sequences and series","concept":1,"title":"Linear number patterns","grades":"Grade 10","goal":"I can find and use the general term of a linear pattern.","teach":"In a <b>linear</b> pattern the difference between consecutive terms is constant. If the constant difference is d, the general term is <b>Tₙ = dn + c</b>, where c = T₁ − d. Use Tₙ to find any term, or to find which term has a given value.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:52px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"31\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"31\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"31\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"31\" cy=\"34\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/></svg></span><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:88px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 68 40\"><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"31\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"31\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"59\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"31\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"31\" cy=\"34\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"59\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"34\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"62\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"62\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/></svg></span><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:125px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 96 40\"><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"31\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"31\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"59\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"87\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"87\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"31\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"31\" cy=\"34\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"59\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"34\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"87\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"87\" cy=\"34\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"62\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"62\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"31\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#555555\"/></svg></span><div class=\"cap\">4; 7; 10 matches: d = 3, so Tₙ = 3n + 1.</div></div>","ex":{"q":"Find Tₙ for 7; 4; 1; −2; … and then T₅₀.","steps":["d = −3, so Tₙ = −3n + c.","T₁ = 7: −3 + c = 7, c = 10. Tₙ = −3n + 10.","T₅₀ = −150 + 10 = −140."]},"watch":"The difference is the number in front of n, not the first term.","qs":[{"text":"Find T₃₀ of 4; 7; 10; …","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"T₃₀","a":"91","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Find Tₙ first.","steps":"1. Formula (linear pattern): Tₙ = dn + c, where d is the constant difference. Find c by putting n = 1 and T₁ into the formula.<br>2. d = 3: Tₙ = 3n + c; 4 = 3 + c, so Tₙ = 3n + 1<br>3. T₃₀ = 3(30) + 1 = 91"},{"text":"Which term of 3; 7; 11; … is 83?","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"n","a":"21","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Find Tₙ, then set it equal to 83.","steps":"1. Formula (linear pattern): Tₙ = dn + c, where d is the constant difference. Find c by putting n = 1 and T₁ into the formula.<br>2. d = 4: Tₙ = 4n + c; 3 = 4 + c, so Tₙ = 4n − 1<br>3. 4n − 1 = 83, so 4n = 84<br>4. n = 21: the 21st term"},{"text":"Find Tₙ for 2; 7; 12; 17; …","vis":"","self":1,"parts":[{"label":"Tₙ ="}],"hint":"d = 5","steps":"1. Formula (linear pattern): Tₙ = dn + c, where d is the constant difference. Find c by putting n = 1 and T₁ into the formula.<br>2. d = 7 − 2 = 5, so Tₙ = 5n + c<br>3. n = 1: 2 = 5 + c, so c = −3<br>4. Tₙ = 5n − 3"}]}